{
  "caption": "Bored or boring? 🥱 The -ed / -ing rule that B1 learners still mix up.\n\n-ed = how you feel · -ing = what causes the feeling\n\nBe honest, which one did you get wrong? 👇 Save it 📌\n\n#learnenglish #englishgrammar #englishmistakes #b1english #esl",
  "slides": [
